Deliverable 4 – AI Email Inbox Assistant

Overview

The AI Email Inbox Assistant is an intelligent email management workflow built in n8n that automatically monitors incoming Gmail messages, analyzes them using OpenAI, prioritizes them based on urgency and intent, stores all email activity in Google Sheets, and sends real-time notifications for important emails.

The system helps businesses reduce inbox clutter, identify sales opportunities faster, and focus on emails that require immediate attention.

⸻

Business Problem

Businesses receive a large volume of emails every day, including:

* Sales inquiries
* Consultation requests
* Information requests
* Support questions
* Newsletters and promotions

Manually reviewing every email is time-consuming and increases the risk of missing important opportunities.

This workflow automates email triage and prioritization using AI.

⸻

Features

Gmail Monitoring

Automatically detects new incoming emails using Gmail Trigger.

AI Email Analysis

OpenAI analyzes each email and extracts:

* Sales Inquiry Detection
* Meeting Request Detection
* Information Request Detection
* Reply Requirement Detection
* Sentiment Analysis
* Email Summary
* Suggested Action

Priority Classification

High Priority

* Meeting requests
* Consultation requests
* Demo requests

Medium Priority

* Sales inquiries
* Information requests
* Emails requiring a response

Low Priority

* Newsletters
* Promotions
* Non-actionable emails

Sentiment Analysis

Classifies emails as:

* Positive
* Neutral
* Negative

AI Summary

Generates a concise summary of the email content.

Suggested Action

Provides a recommended next step for handling the email.

Google Sheets Logging

Stores all processed emails in a centralized database for tracking and reporting.

Real-Time Notifications

* High Priority → Telegram Alert
* Medium Priority → Gmail Notification
* Low Priority → Logged Only

